<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Iron Master - 100,000 coal Richards Bay/Wilhelmshaven RNR scale load/25,000 shex 1-15/3 Preag.</p>
<p>TBN - 150,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Koper $6.50-$6.70 two days shinc/25,000 shinc 25/4-10/5 Voest Alpine.</p>
<p>Kartal 4 - 100,000 tonnes ore Goa/Constanza $6.75 20,000-12,000 shinc/20,000 shinc 1-10/2 Lalemant.</p>
<p>Silvergate - 100,000 ore Goa/Ymuiden RNR 20,000 shinc/40,000 shinc 1-10/2 Grant.</p>
